+  // gem5 functional reads (syscall emulation) of a line whose only fresh copy
+  // is a response in flight find no readable copy; RubySystem then reads the
+  // Maybe_Stale controller with the lowest priority value. Prefer the L2 copy
+  // (20) over memory through the directory (30), as MESI_Two_Level does.
+  // Without a priority gem5 aborts the run (seen when a thread exits while
+  // another core polls its TLS line; unrelated to delegated updates).
